               <text>
                  <paragraph>anhydrous lactose, artificial berry flavor, aspartame, D&amp;C red no. 7 calcium lake, dextrates, FD&amp;C blue no. 1 aluminum lake, FD&amp;C red no. 40 aluminum lake, glyceryl monostearate, lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, polyacrylate dispersion, polysorbate 80, povidone, pregelatinized starch, sodium starch glycolate, talc</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20251008"/>
            </section>
